      "bbox": [
        291,
        1569,
        1511,
        1818
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "A principal objective of this Administration is to encourage and promote the achievement of more jobs, higher levels of income, and expanded and equal opportunity for employment for all the working people of this City. The work of many City departments and agencies is directed toward this objective. To stimulate and coordinate measures directed toward this goal, the following is hereby provided:",
